}}'''Silver Gingerscythe''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife obtained by finishing second on the gifting leaderboard during the [[Christmas Event 2023]].

== Appearance ==
It has the same mesh as the godly variant of [[Gingerscythe]], but it's color scheme has been altered to black-silver colors.

== Trivia ==

* It has [[Gold Gingerscythe|gold]], [[Bronze Gingerscythe|bronze]] and [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Blue_Gingerscythe blue] variants, as well as it's [[Gingerscythe|EVO variant]].
* Like all other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (excluding [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].
* The sole owner of this item is '''[https://www.roblox.com/users/153604099/profile sirehns]'''.

